Application Security

Detect and address security vulnerabilities during the software development process.

You can save time, effort, and cost when you find and remediate security flaws during the coding phase of an application, and have confidence in your security posture as you launch into production. Scan and patch for vulnerabilities in your code and dependencies to help protect against new threats. Minimize the need for human intervention by automating security-related tasks across your development and operations processes and tools. Use static code analysis tools to identify common